<Placemark>
	<name>Nibaeba SDA Church Building 2026-11-17 11:18:59</name>
	<description><![CDATA[<!-- desc_gen:start -->
<font color="black"><table width="100%"><tr><td width="100%" align="center"><a href="files/1000063223.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000063223.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br /><a href="files/1000063224.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="files/1000063224.jpg" width="60px" align="right" style="border: 3px white solid;"></a><br /><br />
<!-- desc_user:start -->
Church building not in use anymore. SDA church members from Kuai & Itokama who attended this church with church members from Niebaiba stopped using this building in October 2025. A clan member of the Sako Clan in Nibaeba asked the Caretaker of the SDA church in Nibaeba to leave his land after the caretaker's son was caught going around with the Sako clan member's daughter. The land on which the church was set up belongs to the Sako Clan.
<!-- desc_user:end -->
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1"><hr></td></tr><tr><td><table width="100%"><tr><td align="left" valign="center"><small><b>Altitude</b></small></td><td align="center" valign="center">794 m</td></tr>
